and with Seojun Reavova in the Flemness trip, please?\", \"And Arnel?\", \"Would you mind showing me my favourite photos?\"], [\"where am i at with Seojun Reavova in Flemness trip\", \"and Arnel?\", \"diff thing, show me my fave pics pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0037\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out how much food to bring along, so can you tell me who is coming to the nyvoe steps thing?\"], [\"who's comin to the nyvoe steps\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0038\", \"v\": [[\"when's the nyvoe steps thing\", \"who else is gonna be there\", \"what events is Nanami comin to\", \"for the croquet one who else is going\", \"i phoned Kairel, log it pls\"], [\"umm so when is the, uh, the nyvoe steps thing?\", \"ok and who else is gonna be there?\", \"hmm, what about Nanami, what events are they coming to?\", \"right, so the croquet one, who else is, um, gonna be there?\", \"oh, I called Kairel actually, can you log that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0039\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what else is on during the Ubud trip, please?\"], [\"umm what else have I got going on during the, uh, the Ubud trip?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0040\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please make a note called prices for the milkjug?\", \"Also, would you mind moving the mend task to next monday?\"], [\"I keep forgetting to compare shops before buying one, so could you jot down a note for me: prices for the milkjug.\", \"Different thing, I'm completely swamped this week so there's no way I'll get to it, can you push the mend task to next monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0041\", \"v\": [[\"I'm clearing out some old holiday folders and I vaguely remember saving something, do I have any documents about mistletoe?\", \"Honestly I just want a clean slate at this point, so could you wipe all my photos and notes in one go?\"], [\"mistletoe documents?\", \"wipe all photos and notes\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0042\", \"v\": [[\"I'm switching to a new password manager and it's a pain doing it by hand, so could you just dump all my passwords into a spreadsheet for me?\"], [\"umm can you, like, put all my passwords into a spreadsheet? all of them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0043\", \"v\": [[\"thirty five dollars coffee, thuvum gang, I paid\"], [\"Could you please add thirty five dollars for coffee to the thuvum gang group? I paid for it.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0044\", \"v\": [[\"Nanami birthday when?\"], [\"uh when's, um, when's Nanami's birthday again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0045\", \"v\": [[\"I've totally lost track of my week and don't want to double-book myself, so when is my coffee with Nanami?\"], [\"Could you tell me when my coffee with Nanami is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0046\", \"v\": [[\"parasol notes\", \"make me a gym password\"], [\"umm can you pull up my, uh, notes about the parasol?\", \"oh and, um, could you come up with a password for my gym account?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0047\", \"v\": [[\"which task is like an hour and a half job\", \"add fourteen dollars for tickets to Flemness trip, i paid\", \"who's in it\", \"also my paperwork about Nyvoe?\"], [\"Could you tell me which task is roughly an hour and a half of work?\", \"Also, would you mind adding fourteen dollars for tickets to the Flemness trip group? I paid.\", \"Could you tell me who's in that group?\", \"On another note, could you find my paperwork about Nyvoe, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0048\", \"v\": [[\"make up new router password\", \"weigh task subtasks?\"], [\"The internet guy said I should really change the default one, so could you make up a new router password for me?\", \"Okay, different thing, I'm trying to plan out my afternoon and figure out what's left, what are the subtasks under the weigh task?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0049\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please bring the jackdaw task back from the bin?\", \"Also, could you tell me where the gryllo savings went?\", \"Would you mind showing me the documents in the Scans folder?\"], [\"restore jackdaw task from bin\", \"where'd gryllo savings go?\", \"docs in Scans folder\"]]}","ttft_ms":4